    is face-up in the Monster Zone, you cannot Special Summon, except \"Performage\"
    monsters. You can only use this effect of \"Performage Wind Drainer\" once per
    turn. If this card is Special Summoned: You can reduce its Level by 1. Once per
    turn: You can change the Levels of all Level 4 \"Performage\" monsters you control
    to Level 5."
